OL,3,ABurnham cancels engagements after death
OL,4,Aof father
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had also said his father's illness
OL,7,Fwas so advanced that he did not know
OL,8,Fhis son had become prime minister.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
