OL,3,ARussia hits Ukrainian train shortly
OL,4,Aafter Boris Johnson and top European
OL,5,Aofficials leave station
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian drone has hit a train near
OL,8,Fthe Ukraine-Poland border shortly after
OL,9,Fformer UK Prime Minister Boris Johnson
OL,10,Fand top European security officials had
OL,11,Fpassed through.
OL,13,FNo casualties were reported after the
OL,14,Fstrike at Yahodyn, which hit the
OL,15,Ftrain's engine. All the passengers had
OL,16,Fbeen evacuated, Ukrainian authorities
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
